===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Scyther|4}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Scyther}}.
*{{m|U-turn}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Scyther}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

